  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FILTERS & ADJUSTMENTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 8, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Filter\n   2 Exposure (brightness set in the edit)\n   3 Warmth set in the edit\n   4 Film texture\n   5 Shot matching\n   6 Texture effect\n   7 Retro look\n   8 Filter family\n   9 LUT (a color recipe)\n  10 Color wheels\n  11 Color curves\n  12 A glow around bright things\n  13 Blacks that swallow the detail\n  14 The picture hardens as things get worse\n  15 A look too perfect to trust\n  16 Colors go wrong when the mind does\nCV-CC 2: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 8, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Dream sequence\n   2 suite: Silent film look (in the edit)\n   3 suite: Zine scrapbook\n   4 suite: Old home video\n   5 suite: Final Cut finishing pass\n   6 suite: True to life grade\n   7 suite: Summer blockbuster grade\n   8 suite: The soft glow of memory\n   9 suite: Into the dark\n  10 suite: The perfect town\n  11 suite: The picture falls apart\n  12 pair: When the focus pulls to an object, the shadows turn\n  13 pair: When the night filter goes on, the scene plays as night\n  14 pair: When the picture is blown out, the whole room seems to glow\n  15 pair: When the color is pushed very warm, the place feels cozy\n  16 pair: When the image turns gritty, the world feels harsh\nCV-CC 3: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 8, CC 81 to 96\n   1 pair: When a shot is graded to clash on purpose, the feeling jumps\n   2 pair: When the blacks are crushed, the contrast jumps\n   3 pair: When the teal and orange recipe goes on, skin stays warm while the rest turns teal\n   4 pair: When a movie filter goes on, black bars come with it\n   5 pair: When the picture gets a polaroid look, copies stack like photos on a table\n   6 pair: When it looks like old home video, the feeling turns bittersweet\n   7 pair: When the bright parts glow more, nostalgia comes\n   8 pair: When the glow has a red edge, the picture looks like old film\n   9 pair: When the glow only comes around one person, tenderness grows\n  10 pair: When the blacks swallow more, dread rises\n  11 pair: When the black hides a person, more is kept from us\n  12 pair: When more of the frame is black, the questions pile up\n  13 pair: When the dark lifts at the reveal, a question is answered\n  14 pair: When the look follows the trouble closely, tension rises\n  15 pair: When the color drains away, hope fades\n  16 pair: When the look gets more perfect, we trust it less\nCV-CC 4: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 8, CC 97 to 102\n   1 pair: When the perfect look breaks apart, everything flips\n   2 pair: When the colors go wrong, we cannot trust what we see\n   3 pairs: Memory box\n   4 pairs: Hard-edge grade\n   5 pairs: The look darkens\n   6 pairs: The lie in the picture"
   },
